        "product_summary": "Platform silhouette: A thick tan sole and low-top paneled upper create a bold casual sneaker look.\nLace-up construction: Flat laces and an additional patterned lace detail pair with the rounded toe profile.\nPanel details: Contrasting toe panels and two stitched side strips define the visible upper design.\nRubber outsole: The source photographs show a grooved bottom and textured sidewall around this platform style.\nAssortment options: Beige, Blue and Yellow, EU 35-40. Choose a color-size ratio for your wholesale range.",
        "company_summary": "Quanzhou Beiqiang Footwear & Apparel Co., Ltd. is a footwear manufacturer based in Quanzhou, Fujian, China. We work with importers, wholesalers, brand owners and e-commerce businesses on wholesale and OEM/ODM footwear projects. From selecting existing styles to developing a design brief, reviewing samples and planning packaging, we help buyers turn their requirements into a clear order plan. Share your product direction and purchasing needs to discuss a suitable cooperation proposal."
